Rule 2 (offset must be within the bounds of the matrix dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ v_2 < shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) + v_2 > 0
