Rule 6 (offset must be within bounds of the matrix dimensions to ensure a non-empty diagonal)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ (if v_2 ≥ 0 then v_2 < shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) else 0 - v_2 < shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2))
